{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Part of #148. Depends on the views fetch.\n\n- The view's date field(s) — `Start date` / `Target date` style pairs — or the iteration field's start / duration give each item a span.\n- Left: the item rows (type glyph, number, title). Right: a time scale (month / week / day headers) with one bar per item, a today marker and shaded iteration bands.\n- `+` / `-` zoom between month / week / day; `h` / `l` scroll horizontally; `j` / `k` move between rows; `Enter` / `i` open the detail pane.\n- Items without a span are listed without a bar.\n- Everything is computed from the items already fetched — no extra API calls.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:06:08Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":152,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: Roadmap layout (timeline over date / iteration fields)"}
